{"id":"en_coconut-revenge","title":"Coconut Revenge","titleEn":"Coconut Revenge","description":"Coconut becomes the wife of Durian, the heir to Fruit City, yet his mother and former fiancée conspire against her, accusing her of unfaithfulness. Though pregnant, she is driven away. Strawberry comes to her rescue, and she later comes back under the identity of \"Golden Coconut\" to seek vengeance. In time, she learns that she is actually the missing princess of the PassionFruit line. With that truth in hand, she brings the Empress's misdeeds to light, takes back what is rightfully hers, and brings about the downfall of those who wronged her.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/coconut-revenge/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/coconut-revenge/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Elite","Female","Glow-Up","Hidden Identity","Melodrama","Payback"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7distm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_coconut-revenge_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7distm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_coconut-revenge_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7distm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_coconut-revenge_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7distm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_coconut-revenge_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7distm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"